    "UIName": "Algea",
    "Id": "chassisdef_algea_ALG-Prime",
    "Name": "Algea",
    "Details": "The Algea's advanced targeting systems and enhanced sensor suite make it a formidable opponent, capable of engaging multiple targets simultaneously with deadly precision. Its armored hull, reinforced by cutting-edge composite materials, offers unparalleled protection against enemy fire, while its sophisticated ECM suite can disrupt enemy communications and sensors, rendering them ineffective against its onslaught.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>",
